{%- comment -%}
  Longeva robots.txt.

  Built on Shopify's default `robots_for_group` output so every standard
  block (checkout disallow, admin disallow, sitemap reference, etc.)
  remains intact. Only adds explicit user-agent allow groups for named
  AI crawlers, after the default groups.

  Bot name sources (primary docs verified 2026-04-24):
    - OpenAI: GPTBot, OAI-SearchBot, ChatGPT-User (platform.openai.com/docs/gptbot)
    - Anthropic: ClaudeBot, Claude-User, Claude-SearchBot (support.claude.com, Feb 2026 three-bot framework)
    - Perplexity: PerplexityBot, Perplexity-User (docs.perplexity.ai)
    - Google AI training: Google-Extended
    - Apple AI training: Applebot-Extended
    - Common Crawl: CCBot
    - Meta AI: FacebookBot, meta-externalagent
    - You.com, Amazon, ByteDance, Cohere, AI2, Bing: named for parity
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- for group in robots.default_groups -%}
  {{- group.user_agent }}
  {%- for rule in group.rules -%}
    {{ rule }}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- if group.sitemap != blank -%}
    {{ group.sitemap }}
  {%- endif %}
{% endfor %}

